@startuml getForwardingConstructAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getForwardingConstructAsync – Retrieve Forwarding-Construct by UUID
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ForwardingDomain" as fdRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - forwardingConstructUuid
end note

requestor -> fdRes: (forwardingConstructUuid)
activate fdRes

fdRes -> jd: read forwarding-domain list
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> fdRes: list of forwarding-constructs
deactivate jd

note over fdRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through forwarding-constructs
  - Match each forwarding-construct's UUID 
    with input forwardingConstructUuid
  - Return forwarding-construct object if match found
  - Return undefined if no match exists
end note

fdRes --> requestor: forwardingConstruct | undefined
deactivate fdRes

@enduml
